<title>USA: PG Energy extends offer for 4.1 pct preferred.</title>
<headline>PG Energy extends offer for 4.1 pct preferred.</headline>
<dateline>WILKES-BARRE, Pa. 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>PG Energy Inc, formerly known as Pennsylvania Gas and Water Co, said Monday it has extended its offer to purchase its 4.10 percent Cumulative Preferred Stock to 1700 EDT/2100 GMT May 23 from May 16. ((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
</text>
